					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-449702#post-4092453</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-449702/scp-001-ex-j#post-4092453</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 19 Dec 2018 18:51:28 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>goomyiscute777</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4342349</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is actually pretty genius. To reference 4445-J (TV Tropes), 001-EX-J &quot;&#8230;can still do unpredictable, devastating things, even in the modern era. It is NOT safe. It is NOT controllable, and it exists EVERYWHERE and can pop up from nowhere and wreak havoc. Fire itself, while EXPLAINED, can never be contained completely, or controlled completely and can appear anywhere, even from the air (lightning). Fascinating that this is not a former Keter object that is now understood, because fire can never be contained no matter how many fires you extinguish.&quot; I live in California, so I know firsthand how destructive this can be.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
