					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-449702#post-1608909</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-449702/scp-001-ex-j#post-1608909</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 07 Nov 2012 13:14:25 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>VAElynx</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>914331</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I LOL'd. Thing what kills you indeed.<br /> Also, thanks for the appreciation.</p> <p>As an aside, slightly polished version of a joke I thought up when chatting with Echo the other day, reflecting on a particularly idiotic formulation on an old SCP, a parasite who they tried to kill with arbitrary low temperatures and pressures, reflecting that it's indestructible based on the result.</p> <blockquote> <p>Happening-III - Try kill Thing-███<br /> TRY: I<br /> WHO TRIED: Shaman A██<br /> THING TRIED: Step on Thing-███<br /> WHAT HAPPENED: No kill Thing-███</p> <p>TRY: II<br /> WHO TRIED: Shaman A██<br /> THING TRIED: Poke Thing-I with spear.<br /> WHAT HAPPENED: No kill Thing-███</p> <p>TRY: III<br /> WHO TRIED: Shaman A██<br /> THING TRIED: Put spear in Thing-I, put spear on Thing-███<br /> WHAT HAPPENED: No kill Thing-███</p> <p>TRY: IIII<br /> WHO TRIED: Shaman A██<br /> THING TRIED: Piss on Thing-███<br /> WHAT HAPPENED: No kill Thing-███</p> <p>CONCLUSION: All modern method no kill Thing-███</p> </blockquote> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-449702#post-1608877</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-449702/scp-001-ex-j#post-1608877</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 07 Nov 2012 12:13:41 +0000</pubDate>
