					<![CDATA[
						 <p>[[sarcasm]]</p> <p>I'm sorry, but I'm not sure I like this SCP at all. It feels like a tacked-on &quot;thing what kills you&quot;, with hints of &quot;thing what lets you fight good&quot;. The writing and grammar is horrendous, especially in parts by the CKG Gathering. Downvoted.</p> <p>[[/sarcasm]]</p> <p>Jokes aside, great -J. I laughed for nearly five minutes at the mere thought of level one personnel with bearskins. Upvoted hard.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
